    "updated_at": "2016-03-22T20:07:57Z",
    "body": "IMHO, not rejecting with null and using more specific exceptions are two separate issues, which should perhaps be dealt with separately.  If we start using EncodingError in this spec, we should probably use it everywhere where it makes sense, and not just in the place we're looking at right now. WDYT?\n",
